      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You must be very careful about mixing herbal supplements with anticoagulants like warfarin. St. John's Wort can interact dangerously with warfarin, potentially causing your blood to thin too much or too little. Before starting anything, you need to discuss this with your prescribing doctor or pharmacist to ensure your medication levels remain safe.",
