      "content": "idk i just dont want to deal with the whole doctor thing again if its just gonna be a lecture. if i just take a really small dose, like half a pill or something, can i just keep a close eye on things myself? like if i see any bruising or something i'll just stop. wouldn't a tiny bit be fine to just see how i feel?",
